{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2022-03-17 12:41:00', 'title': 'MCCANN WORLDGROUP PROMOTES FERNANDO FASCIOLI, EXPANDS ROLE AS PRESIDENT, EUROPE & UK', 'text': 'VETERAN LEADER ALSO ASSUMES NEW ROLE AS CHAIRMAN, LATIN AMERICA NEW YORK , MARCH 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MCCANN WORLDGROUP TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT FERNANDO FASCIOLI HAS BEEN PROMOTED TO PRESIDENT, EUROPE AND UK. IN ADDITION, HE HAS ALSO BEEN PROMOTED TO CHAIRMAN LATIN AMERICA, WHERE HE HAS SERVED AS PRESIDENT SINCE 2014.'}{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2022-03-17 09:02:00', 'title': 'MCCANN WORLDGROUP RECOGNIZED AS THE 2022 NETWORK OF THE YEAR IN WARC GLOBAL EFFECTIVENESS RANKINGS', 'text': 'MCCANN WORLDGROUP WINS COVETED HONOR FOR SECOND CONSECUTIVE YEAR NEW YORK , MARCH 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MCCANN WORLDGROUP WAS NAMED THE #1 MOST EFFECTIVE ADVERTISING NETWORK IN THE 2022 WARC EFFECTIVE 100 RANKINGS. THE WARC AWARDS CELEBRATE EXCELLENCE IN CREATIVITY, MEDIA AND EFFECTIVENESS FOR THE MARKETING INDUSTRY WORLDWIDE.'}